{
    "Notes":  "Sarah Greene, armorsmith (3471x841). Guide: the armor is on a dead thief in the Underground, under a Mutated Garbage Flea. Not the Shady Guy. Generated by ddogs/tools/Build-NewbieQuests.ps1.",
