    "Lines":  {
                  "offer_armor":  {
                                      "Text":  [
                                                   "Someone stole a DNA-Locked Prototype Raven Combat Armor. The thief is dead in the Underground under the market, under a Mutated Garbage Flea.",
                                                   "{delay 1}Garbage Fleas line that path. Bring the armor back. The Shady Guy south of the landing is a different crook."
